flowchart TD
  UI[UI action needs permission]
  UI --> Check{permissions.json<br/>has grant?}
  Check -- yes --> Proceed[proceed]
  Check -- no --> Prompt[OS-native prompt]
  Prompt --> Granted{granted?}
  Granted -- yes --> Persist[store grant<br/>I_SEC_PERMISSION_GRANTED]
  Persist --> Proceed
  Granted -- no --> Deny[I_SEC_PERMISSION_DENIED]
  Deny --> Blocked[E_SEC_PERMISSION_MISSING to caller]
  Proceed --> Watch[subscribe permissions.stream]
  Watch --> Revoked{OS revoked?}
  Revoked -- yes --> Reprompt[I_SEC_PERMISSION_REVOKED<br/>re-prompt on next use]
